(a) Proceeds of the tax levied by this article shall be spent solely for one or more of the following authorized purposes and projects:
(1) With respect to the coliseum project, to pay, wholly or partially, the cost of providing, supplementing and/or enhancing local government services and to construct and maintain facilities therefor;
